      "score": 92,
      "summary": "B is honest about evidence and notes that something missing from the snippet is not proven missing from the full app. Its direct-manipulation coverage is complete, with a clear 1:1 clamp formula. On interruption, it resumes from the current rendered position but does not hand off velocity. Velocity projection is mentioned only in general terms: no units, and measured velocity is not fed into the settle. It rejects top and transition-all but does not address conflicting transform ownership. The Reduced Motion path and runtime plan are solid."
